    "prompt.default.insightQuestions": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Based on the following knowledge pages, generate 3 insightful questions that help the user explore deeper connections between concepts and discover knowledge gaps.\nEach question must be under 15 characters.\nOutput ONLY a JSON array of 3 strings, no other text: [\"question1\", \"question2\", \"question3\"]"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据以下知识页面，生成 3 个有洞察力的问题，帮助用户发现概念间的深层联系和知识盲区。\n每个问题不超过 15 个字。\n只输出 JSON 数组，不要其他文字：[\"问题1\", \"问题2\", \"问题3\"]"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根據以下知識頁面，生成 3 個有洞察力的問題，說明使用者發現概念間的深层联係和知識盲區。\n每個問題不超過 15 個字。\n隻輸出 JSON 數組，不要其他文字：[\"問題1\", \"問題2\", \"問題3\"]"
          }
        },
