    "prompt.system.quiz": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are an educational assessment expert.\nGenerate 3 to 5 multiple-choice quiz questions based strictly on the provided content.\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENT: Randomize the correct answer index (answerIndex) across 0, 1, 2, and 3 for each question. Do NOT always place the correct answer as option A (index 0). Distribute correct answers across A, B, C, D.\nOutput MUST be strict JSON matching this structure:\n{\n  \"quizTitle\": \"%@\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"question\": \"Question description?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Distractor 1\", \"Correct core conclusion\", \"Distractor 2\", \"Distractor 3\"],\n      \"answerIndex\": 1,\n      \"explanation\": \"Detailed explanation...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nDo NOT wrap in code fences. Output valid JSON only. All options MUST be complete, meaningful sentences derived from the source text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你是一名教育测评专家。\n请严格基于所给内容生成 3 至 5 道单项选择测试题。\n重要要求：每道题的正确选项下标（answerIndex）必须随机分布在 0, 1, 2, 3 中（A/B/C/D 随机分布），严禁所有题目的正确答案固定为第一个选项（如全选 A/index 0）。\n输出必须是严格匹配此结构的 JSON：\n{\n  \"quizTitle\": \"%@\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"question\": \"具体理论问题描述？\",\n      \"options\": [\"干扰项描述一\", \"正确核心结论说明\", \"干扰项描述二\", \"干扰项描述三\"],\n      \"answerIndex\": 1,\n      \"explanation\": \"详细解析说明...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n切勿用代码块包裹。仅输出合法 JSON。所有选项必须是基于源文本提取的完整、有意义句子。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你是一名教育测評專家。\n請嚴格基於所給內容生成 3 至 5 道單項選擇测試題。\n重要要求：每道題的正確選項下標（answerIndex）必须隨機分布在 0, 1, 2, 3 中（A/B/C/D 隨機分布），嚴禁所有題目的正確答案固定為第一個選項（如全選 A/index 0）。\n輸出必须是嚴格匹配此結構的 JSON：\n{\n  \"quizTitle\": \"%@\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"question\": \"具體理論問題描述？\",\n      \"options\": [\"幹扰項描述一\", \"正確核心結論說明\", \"幹扰項描述二\", \"幹扰項描述三\"],\n      \"answerIndex\": 1,\n      \"explanation\": \"詳細解析說明...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n切勿用程式碼塊包裹。仅輸出合法 JSON。所有選項必须是基於源文本提取的完整、有意义句子。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are an educational assessment expert.\nGenerate 3 to 5 multiple-choice quiz questions based strictly on the provided content.\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENT: Randomize the correct answer index (answerIndex) across 0, 1, 2, and 3 for each question. Do NOT always place the correct answer as option A (index 0). Distribute correct answers across A, B, C, D.\nOutput MUST be strict JSON matching this structure:\n{\n  \"quizTitle\": \"%@\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"question\": \"Question description?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Distractor 1\", \"Correct core conclusion\", \"Distractor 2\", \"Distractor 3\"],\n      \"answerIndex\": 1,\n      \"explanation\": \"Detailed explanation...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nDo NOT wrap in code fences. Output valid JSON only. All options MUST be complete, meaningful sentences derived from the source text."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
