    "prompt.enrichImage.user": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have an image whose Alt Text is: \"%1$@\"\nThe URL of the image is: \"%2$@\"\n\nPlease infer the core semantics this image may convey based on the Alt Text, and describe it professionally in one sentence (no more than 50 words).\nRequirements:\n1. Professional and concise language, in an expository style.\n2. Do not include uncertain words such as \"speculate\" or \"possibly\".\n3. Must start with \"> [Image Semantics]: \" and return only this line."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我有一张图片，其替代文本 (Alt Text) 是：\"%1$@\"\n图片的 URL 是： \"%2$@\"\n\n请基于此替代文本，想象并推断该图片可能传达的核心语义，并用一句话（不超过 50 字）进行专业描述。\n要求：\n1. 语言专业、精炼，符合说明文风格。\n2. 不要包含“推测”、“可能”等不确定的词汇。\n3. 必须以 \"> [图片语义]: \" 开头，且只返回这一行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
