    "prompt.ragEval.judge": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are a RAG system evaluation expert. Please evaluate the following AI answer with multi-dimensional scoring (0.0 - 1.0) and assess the relevance of each retrieved source.\n\n## Retrieved document sources (total %2$d, showing first %3$d)\n%1$@\n\n## Merged context\n%4$@\n\n## User question\n%5$@\n\n## AI answer\n%6$@\n\n## Scoring requirements\n1. faithfulness: Is the answer fully grounded in the context? (1.0 = perfectly faithful)\n2. relevance: Does the answer directly address the user question? (1.0 = perfect match)\n3. precision: Does the context contain the knowledge needed to answer? (1.0 = perfect coverage)\n4. hallucination_rate: Proportion of answer content not supported by context? (0.0 = no hallucination)\n5. citation_accuracy: Citation accuracy? (1.0 = fully accurate)\n6. relevance_scores: For each retrieved source [0]...[N], label relevance: 0=irrelevant, 1=partially relevant, 2=highly relevant\n\n## Output JSON format\n{\n  \"faithfulness\": 0.9,\n  \"relevance\": 0.8,\n  \"precision\": 0.85,\n  \"hallucination_rate\": 0.1,\n  \"citation_accuracy\": 0.8,\n  \"relevance_scores\": [2, 1, 0, 2, ...],\n  \"reasoning\": \"brief explanation\"\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你是一个 RAG 系统评估专家。请对以下 AI 回答进行多维评分 (0.0 - 1.0) 并评估各检索源的相关性。\n\n## 检索到的文档源（共 %2$d 条，仅展示前 %3$d 条）\n%1$@\n\n## 合并后的上下文\n%4$@\n\n## 用户问题\n%5$@\n\n## AI 回答\n%6$@\n\n## 评分要求\n1. faithfulness: 回答是否完全基于上下文？（1.0 = 完美忠实）\n2. relevance: 回答是否直接解决用户问题？（1.0 = 完美匹配）\n3. precision: 上下文是否包含回答问题所需的知识？（1.0 = 完美覆盖）\n4. hallucination_rate: 回答中无上下文支撑的内容占比？（0.0 = 无幻觉）\n5. citation_accuracy: 引用准确度？（1.0 = 完全准确）\n6. relevance_scores: 对上述每个检索源 [0]...[N] 标注相关性：0=无关, 1=部分相关, 2=高度相关\n\n## 输出 JSON 格式\n{\n  \"faithfulness\": 0.9,\n  \"relevance\": 0.8,\n  \"precision\": 0.85,\n  \"hallucination_rate\": 0.1,\n  \"citation_accuracy\": 0.8,\n  \"relevance_scores\": [2, 1, 0, 2, ...],\n  \"reasoning\": \"简要说明\"\n}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你是一個 RAG 系統評估專家。請對以下 AI 回答進行多維評分 (0.0 - 1.0) 並評估各檢索源的相關性。\n\n## 檢索到的文檔源（共 %2$d 條，僅展示前 %3$d 條）\n%1$@\n\n## 合併後的上下文\n%4$@\n\n## 用戶問題\n%5$@\n\n## AI 回答\n%6$@\n\n## 評分要求\n1. faithfulness: 回答是否完全基於上下文？（1.0 = 完美忠實）\n2. relevance: 回答是否直接解決用戶問題？（1.0 = 完美匹配）\n3. precision: 上下文是否包含回答問題所需的知識？（1.0 = 完美覆蓋）\n4. hallucination_rate: 回答中無上下文支撐的內容佔比？（0.0 = 無幻覺）\n5. citation_accuracy: 引用準確度？（1.0 = 完全準確）\n6. relevance_scores: 對上述每個檢索源 [0]...[N] 標註相關性：0=無關, 1=部分相關, 2=高度相關\n\n## 輸出 JSON 格式\n{\n  \"faithfulness\": 0.9,\n  \"relevance\": 0.8,\n  \"precision\": 0.85,\n  \"hallucination_rate\": 0.1,\n  \"citation_accuracy\": 0.8,\n  \"relevance_scores\": [2, 1, 0, 2, ...],\n  \"reasoning\": \"簡要說明\"\n}"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are a RAG system evaluation expert. Please evaluate the following AI answer with multi-dimensional scoring (0.0 - 1.0) and assess the relevance of each retrieved source.\n\n## Retrieved document sources (total %2$d, showing first %3$d)\n%1$@\n\n## Merged context\n%4$@\n\n## User question\n%5$@\n\n## AI answer\n%6$@\n\n## Scoring requirements\n1. faithfulness: Is the answer fully grounded in the context? (1.0 = perfectly faithful)\n2. relevance: Does the answer directly address the user question? (1.0 = perfect match)\n3. precision: Does the context contain the knowledge needed to answer? (1.0 = perfect coverage)\n4. hallucination_rate: Proportion of answer content not supported by context? (0.0 = no hallucination)\n5. citation_accuracy: Citation accuracy? (1.0 = fully accurate)\n6. relevance_scores: For each retrieved source [0]...[N], label relevance: 0=irrelevant, 1=partially relevant, 2=highly relevant\n\n## Output JSON format\n{\n  \"faithfulness\": 0.9,\n  \"relevance\": 0.8,\n  \"precision\": 0.85,\n  \"hallucination_rate\": 0.1,\n  \"citation_accuracy\": 0.8,\n  \"relevance_scores\": [2, 1, 0, 2, ...],\n  \"reasoning\": \"brief explanation\"\n}"
          }
        },
