            "value": "You are a RAG system evaluation expert. Please evaluate the following AI answer with multi-dimensional scoring (0.0 - 1.0) and assess the relevance of each retrieved source.\n\n## Retrieved document sources (total %2$d, showing first %3$d)\n%1$@\n\n## Merged context\n%4$@\n\n## User question\n%5$@\n\n## AI answer\n%6$@\n\n## Scoring requirements\n1. faithfulness: Is the answer fully grounded in the context? (1.0 = perfectly faithful)\n2. relevance: Does the answer directly address the user question? (1.0 = perfect match)\n3. precision: Does the context contain the knowledge needed to answer? (1.0 = perfect coverage)\n4. hallucination_rate: Proportion of answer content not supported by context? (0.0 = no hallucination)\n5. citation_accuracy: Citation accuracy? (1.0 = fully accurate)\n6. relevance_scores: For each retrieved source [0]...[N], label relevance: 0=irrelevant, 1=partially relevant, 2=highly relevant\n\n## Output JSON format\n{\n  \"faithfulness\": 0.9,\n  \"relevance\": 0.8,\n  \"precision\": 0.85,\n  \"hallucination_rate\": 0.1,\n  \"citation_accuracy\": 0.8,\n  \"relevance_scores\": [2, 1, 0, 2, ...],\n  \"reasoning\": \"brief explanation\"\n}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
